  "created": "2026-11-20T10:58:22.607Z",
  "description": "The ExpertPdf PDF Viewer displays PDF documents in web pages with a built-in viewer that works in every modern browser: page thumbnails, document outline (bookmarks) and attachments panels, text search and selection, zoom, page layouts and printing. No browser plug-in and no Adobe Reader are needed.\n\nFeatures\n- ASP.NET Core (.NET 8+): the expertpdf-viewer tag helper and the UseExpertPdfViewer middleware\n- ASP.NET Web Forms (.NET Framework 4.6.2+): the PdfViewer server control, serving the viewer files itself (no web.config changes)\n- Display a document from an address, or from memory (a document you just created or converted)\n- Opening page, zoom, fit mode, page layout, navigation panels, toolbar, print and download buttons\n- Apply viewer preferences and security options (passwords, print and copy permissions) to the displayed document\n- JavaScript client API to drive the viewer from the page: navigation, zoom, layout, print, events",
