  "readmeFile": "docs\\README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 10: a built-in PDF.js viewer that works in every modern browser (no Adobe Reader or plug-in). New ASP.NET Core tag helper and middleware, JavaScript client API, .NET Framework 4.6.2+ and .NET 8+. Find text from the client API (find, findNext, findPrevious, searchcompleted), passwordrequired client event for password protected documents, light or dark theme (ViewerTheme) and individual toolbar buttons can be hidden.",
